    "title": "Chazy shuts out Hartford, moves on to Class D regional - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Ricky St. Clair ,\n1 days ago\nChazy improved to 20-0 with a 3-0 win over Hartford on Wednesday, advancing to the NYSPHSAA Class D boys soccer regional round. WATERFORD | Chazy remained unbeaten Wednesday, scoring once in the first half and twice late in the second to defeat Hartford 3-0 in a NYSPHSAA Class D boys soccer sub-regional at Waterford-Halfmoon.\nRead full article\nAdd to Preferred Sources",
